# Docker AWS Web App

This project demonstrates deployment of a Dockerized static web application on AWS EC2 using nginx.

## Technologies Used

* Docker
* AWS EC2
* nginx
* HTML
* Linux

## Features

* Built Docker image using Dockerfile
* Deployed application on AWS EC2
* Configured Security Groups for public access
* Served application using nginx

## Deployment Steps

1. Launch EC2 instance
2. Install Docker
3. Create Dockerfile
4. Build Docker image
5. Run Docker container
6. Access application using public IP

